From 575708c546982771cc63996862c371808169fbd4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Charliechen114514 <725610365@qq.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 23:18:37 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: rockchip: keep topeet NPU resources clear of
 IOMMUs

The vendor-style 64 KiB NPU windows encompass the separately registered
Rockchip IOMMU registers at offsets 0x9000/0xa000. NPU probe therefore
logs an EBUSY resource error and takes the driver's unreserved mapping
fallback even though initialization succeeds.

Describe only the PC/CNA/CORE control banks used by the ported driver,
covering offsets 0 through 0x3fff for each core. These are the same banks
listed separately in the mainline rknn-core nodes. The IOMMU resources
remain owned by their own devices. NPU task command streams do not use
the CPU register mapping and are unaffected by its extent.

Fixes: 71fa2f577d47 ("drivers/rknpu: port vendor RKNPU 0.9.x driver to mainline 7.3.1")
Signed-off-by: Charliechen114514 <725610365@qq.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3588-topeet.dts | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3588-topeet.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3588-topeet.dts
index ed4d96db5..741729f98 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3588-topeet.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3588-topeet.dts
@@ -1025,9 +1025,10 @@ reboot_mode: reboot-mode {
 / {
 	rknpu: rknpu@fdab0000 {
 		compatible = "rockchip,rk3588-rknpu";
-		reg = <0x0 0xfdab0000 0x0 0x10000>,
-		      <0x0 0xfdac0000 0x0 0x10000>,
-		      <0x0 0xfdad0000 0x0 0x10000>;
+		/* 只登记 PC/CNA/CORE 控制区,不能抢占 0x9000/0xa000 的独立 IOMMU。 */
+		reg = <0x0 0xfdab0000 0x0 0x4000>,
+		      <0x0 0xfdac0000 0x0 0x4000>,
+		      <0x0 0xfdad0000 0x0 0x4000>;
 		interrupts = <GIC_SPI 110 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH 0>,
 			     <GIC_SPI 111 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH 0>,
 			     <GIC_SPI 112 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH 0>;
-- 
